        <p>
          Gross monthly compensation for senior leadership combines Basic Pay, House Rent Allowance (evaluated at 27% in Tier-1 cities like New Delhi, Mumbai, or Chennai), and Transport Allowance. The table below illustrates starting monthly totals under a <strong>2.28 Fitment Factor</strong>:
        </p>

